def compute_basic_eval_measures(cm, model_name=""):

    from pandas import Series

    TP = cm[1,1]
    TN = cm[0,0]
    FP = cm[0,1]
    FN = cm[1,0]

    accuracy = (TP + TN)/cm.sum()
    precision = TP/(TP + FP)
    recall = TP/(TP + FN)
    F1 = 2*precision*recall/(precision + recall)

    return Series(data=[accuracy, precision, recall, F1],
                  index=['accuracy', 'precision', 'recall', 'F1'],
                  name=model_name)
Iskomentarisati:
Accuracy - % tačnog predviđanja.
Precision - % realne procene izlazne varijable.
Recall - % realne vrednosti koja je predviđena.
F1 - % greške. 
